      "rendered": "<h2><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"4664\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/09/05/plastic-weave-001/material_1156/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"plastic weave furniture\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4664\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"plastic weave furniture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=113%2C150&amp;ssl=1 113w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=225%2C300&amp;ssl=1 225w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=248%2C330&amp;ssl=1 248w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=180%2C240&amp;ssl=1 180w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"4664\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/09/05/plastic-weave-001/material_1156/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"plastic weave furniture\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4664 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"plastic weave furniture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=113%2C150&amp;ssl=1 113w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=225%2C300&amp;ssl=1 225w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=248%2C330&amp;ssl=1 248w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg?resize=180%2C240&amp;ssl=1 180w\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Material_1156.jpg\"></h2>\n<h2>Plastic Weave 001 – Free seamless texture, 1024 x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n<li>Opacity</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS and a SBSAR files (<a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a style=\"outline-width: 0px !important; user-select: auto !important;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1nYUhDgb0PfkninNQ4xw1viWXy0BQ48Oy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-01